AccountV3Security
├── prepare a SecurityChange
│   ├── require current ADMIN, current nonce/version/manifest and a live consent window
│   ├── each new or role-changed key proves possession of this exact proposal
│   ├── reject another pending proposal; leave current authority unchanged
│   └── consume nonce, store bounded deadline, require fresh current ADMIN to commit
├── cancel
│   ├── exact pending proposal + fresh current ADMIN quorum
│   └── SPEND-only member, former member and replay cannot cancel
├── expire
│   └── clear only expired proposal; consumed nonces never return
├── freeze upgrades
│   └── current ADMIN; monotonic freeze, cancel pending upgrade, no asset movement
└── invariants
    ├── manifest/version advance exactly once per accepted policy
    ├── account-local monotonic nonces and reachable SPEND/ADMIN
    ├── no RECOVERY role, assisted authority or individual veto
    └── security transitions do not move ETH/ERC20 or change implementation
